# What a build of this repository does not need.
#
# Two build paths read this file: the site image built from
# deploy/cranl/Dockerfile, and Railpack, which honours ignore files when it
# assembles the build context and then runs `npm run build`. So nothing the
# build itself reads may be listed here — `src/`, `tools/` and the manifests are
# deliberately absent. Only what neither path needs is ignored, which keeps the
# context small without breaking the build: the brand guidelines alone are about
# 30 MB of PDF and PowerPoint.
.git
.github
node_modules
out
docs
scratch
image-prompts.txt
